dsh-ai-jobs README · Quick start：```
ai_jobs_refresh                     # index every watched board (first run: ~10s for 3 big boards)
ai_jobs_search { "tier": "core", "postedWithinDays": 7, "minScore": 70 }
ai_jobs_requirements { "tier": "core", "limit": 200 }
ai_jobs_digest

